      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityoffoleymo.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The city lies within Lincoln County, placing it in the heart of southeastern Missouri’s rural landscape.",
